<!doctype html>
<html lang="en" data-theme="dark">
<head>
<meta charset="utf-8">
<meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1, viewport-fit=cover">
<meta name="description" content="Nyx — your local PC copilot. Runs on your machine, plans in the open, acts only when you approve.">
<title>Nyx — your local PC copilot</title>
<link rel="icon" href="logo.svg" type="image/svg+xml">
<link rel="preconnect" href="https://fonts.googleapis.com">
<link rel="preconnect" href="https://fonts.gstatic.com" crossorigin>
<link href="https://fonts.googleapis.com/css2?family=Space+Grotesk:wght@400;500;600;700&family=Inter:wght@400;450;500;600&family=JetBrains+Mono:wght@400;500&display=swap" rel="stylesheet">
<script>(function(){try{var t=localStorage.getItem('nyx-theme');if(!t)t=matchMedia('(prefers-color-scheme: light)').matches?'light':'dark';document.documentElement.setAttribute('data-theme',t)}catch(e){}})();</script>
<style>
:root{
  --bg:#0a0a0a; --bg-elev:#151618; --panel:#1c1d20; --text:#f4f4f5; --muted:#a6a6b0; --faint:#71717c;
  --line:rgba(255,255,255,.12); --line2:rgba(255,255,255,.22); --chip:#212226;
  --shadow:0 40px 90px -50px rgba(0,0,0,.9);
  --ok:#5fd08a; --bad:#f2726f;
  --logo-invert:0; --grid:rgba(255,255,255,.04);
  --radius:16px; --radlg:22px; color-scheme:dark;
}
[data-theme=light]{
  --bg:#ffffff; --bg-elev:#ffffff; --panel:#fafafa; --text:#0a0a0a; --muted:#52525b; --faint:#9a9aa3;
  --line:rgba(0,0,0,.10); --line2:rgba(0,0,0,.20); --chip:#f4f4f5;
  --shadow:0 28px 64px -40px rgba(0,0,0,.30);
  --ok:#15914e; --bad:#d63a37;
  --logo-invert:1; --grid:rgba(0,0,0,.045);
  color-scheme:light;
}
*{box-sizing:border-box}
html{scroll-behavior:smooth;-webkit-text-size-adjust:100%}
body{margin:0;background:var(--bg);color:var(--text);font-family:'Inter',system-ui,-apple-system,Segoe UI,Roboto,sans-serif;line-height:1.55;-webkit-font-smoothing:antialiased;overflow-x:hidden}
a{color:inherit;text-decoration:none}
p{margin:0}
img,svg{display:block}
.disp{font-family:'Space Grotesk','Inter',sans-serif;font-weight:600;letter-spacing:-.03em;line-height:1.02;margin:0}
.mono{font-family:'JetBrains Mono',monospace}
.wrap{max-width:1160px;margin:0 auto;padding:0 24px}
.eyebrow{font:500 12px/1 'JetBrains Mono',monospace;letter-spacing:.22em;text-transform:uppercase;color:var(--faint)}

.bg-grid{position:fixed;inset:0;z-index:-2;pointer-events:none;background-image:linear-gradient(var(--grid) 1px,transparent 1px),linear-gradient(90deg,var(--grid) 1px,transparent 1px);background-size:72px 72px;-webkit-mask:radial-gradient(100% 65% at 50% 0%,#000,transparent 78%);mask:radial-gradient(100% 65% at 50% 0%,#000,transparent 78%)}
.bg-glow{position:fixed;top:-30%;left:50%;transform:translateX(-50%);width:120vw;height:70vh;z-index:-2;pointer-events:none;background:radial-gradient(closest-side,color-mix(in srgb,var(--text) 6%,transparent),transparent 70%)}
.progress{position:fixed;top:0;left:0;height:2px;width:0;z-index:200;background:var(--text)}

.logo{height:26px;width:auto;filter:invert(var(--logo-invert))}
.brand{display:flex;align-items:center;gap:10px;font-family:'Space Grotesk';font-weight:600;font-size:20px;letter-spacing:-.02em;color:var(--text)}

.nav{position:sticky;top:0;z-index:100;padding:14px 0}
.nav-in{display:flex;align-items:center;gap:16px;padding:10px 10px 10px 18px;border:1px solid transparent;border-radius:16px;transition:.35s}
.nav.scrolled .nav-in{border-color:var(--line);background:color-mix(in srgb,var(--bg) 72%,transparent);backdrop-filter:blur(16px);box-shadow:var(--shadow)}
.nav-links{display:flex;gap:2px;margin-left:10px}
.nav-links a{padding:8px 13px;border-radius:9px;font:450 14px/1 'Inter';color:var(--muted);transition:.2s}
.nav-links a:hover{color:var(--text);background:var(--chip)}
.controls{display:flex;align-items:center;gap:8px;margin-left:auto}
.ctrl{height:38px;display:inline-flex;align-items:center;gap:7px;padding:0 12px;border-radius:10px;border:1px solid var(--line);background:transparent;color:var(--text);cursor:pointer;font:500 12px/1 'JetBrains Mono',monospace;transition:.2s}
.ctrl:hover{border-color:var(--line2)}
.ctrl.icon{width:38px;justify-content:center;padding:0}
.ctrl svg{width:17px;height:17px}
.lang{position:relative}
.menu{position:absolute;right:0;top:46px;min-width:170px;padding:6px;border-radius:14px;background:color-mix(in srgb,var(--panel) 96%,var(--bg));backdrop-filter:blur(22px);border:1px solid var(--line2);box-shadow:var(--shadow);display:none;z-index:120}
.lang.open .menu{display:block;animation:pop .18s ease}
@keyframes pop{from{opacity:0;transform:translateY(-6px)}to{opacity:1;transform:none}}
.menu button{display:block;width:100%;text-align:left;padding:9px 12px;border:0;border-radius:9px;background:transparent;color:var(--text);font:450 13px/1 'Inter';cursor:pointer;transition:.15s}
.menu button:hover{background:var(--chip)}
.menu button[aria-selected=true]{font-weight:600;background:var(--chip)}
.tswitch{position:relative;width:64px;height:34px;border-radius:999px;border:1px solid var(--line);background:var(--chip);cursor:pointer;padding:0;flex:none;transition:border-color .2s,background .2s}
.tswitch:hover{border-color:var(--line2)}
.tswitch-thumb{position:absolute;top:3px;left:3px;width:28px;height:28px;border-radius:50%;background:var(--text);transition:transform .32s cubic-bezier(.5,1.3,.7,1.05)}
[data-theme=dark] .tswitch-thumb{transform:translateX(30px)}
.tswitch-ico{position:absolute;top:0;height:34px;width:28px;display:grid;place-items:center;z-index:1;color:var(--faint);pointer-events:none}
.tswitch-ico svg{width:15px;height:15px}
.tswitch-ico.sun{left:3px}
.tswitch-ico.moon{right:3px}
[data-theme=light] .tswitch-ico.sun{color:var(--bg)}
[data-theme=dark] .tswitch-ico.moon{color:var(--bg)}

.btn{position:relative;display:inline-flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center;gap:9px;padding:13px 20px;border-radius:12px;font:500 14.5px/1 'Inter';cursor:pointer;border:1px solid var(--line);color:var(--text);background:transparent;transition:transform .2s cubic-bezier(.2,.8,.2,1),border-color .2s,background .2s,color .2s;white-space:nowrap}
.btn:hover{transform:translateY(-1px);border-color:var(--line2)}
.btn-primary{background:var(--text);color:var(--bg);border-color:var(--text);font-weight:600}
.btn-primary:hover{opacity:.9}
.btn-sm{padding:9px 14px;font-size:13.5px;border-radius:10px}
.arw{transition:transform .2s}
.btn:hover .arw{transform:translateX(3px)}

.hero{position:relative;padding:min(12vh,96px) 0 80px}
.hero-grid{display:grid;grid-template-columns:1.02fr .98fr;gap:60px;align-items:start}
.hero h1{font-size:clamp(48px,7.4vw,88px);letter-spacing:-.04em;max-width:12ch;animation:up .8s cubic-bezier(.2,.85,.2,1) both}
@keyframes up{from{opacity:0;transform:translateY(.35em)}to{opacity:1;transform:none}}
.lead{margin-top:26px;max-width:44ch;font-size:clamp(16.5px,1.7vw,19px);color:var(--muted)}
.cta-row{display:flex;gap:12px;flex-wrap:wrap;margin-top:32px}
.trust{display:flex;gap:20px;flex-wrap:wrap;margin-top:30px;font:450 13px/1 'JetBrains Mono',monospace;color:var(--faint)}
.trust span{display:inline-flex;align-items:center;gap:8px}
.trust b{width:5px;height:5px;border-radius:50%;background:var(--faint);display:inline-block}

.chat{position:relative;border:1px solid var(--line2);border-radius:var(--radlg);background:var(--bg-elev);box-shadow:var(--shadow),inset 0 1px 0 color-mix(in srgb,var(--text) 9%,transparent);overflow:hidden}
.chat-head{display:flex;align-items:center;gap:11px;padding:14px 16px;border-bottom:1px solid var(--line)}
.chat-av{width:30px;height:30px;border-radius:9px;display:grid;place-items:center;flex:none;overflow:hidden}
.chat-av img{width:30px;height:30px;filter:invert(var(--logo-invert))}
.chat-id{font:600 14px/1.1 'Space Grotesk'}
.chat-id small{display:block;font:450 11px/1.3 'JetBrains Mono';color:var(--faint);margin-top:3px;letter-spacing:.02em}
.chat-status{margin-left:auto;display:inline-flex;align-items:center;gap:7px;font:500 11px/1 'JetBrains Mono';letter-spacing:.1em;text-transform:uppercase;color:var(--muted)}
.chat-status i{width:7px;height:7px;border-radius:50%;background:var(--ok);box-shadow:0 0 0 0 color-mix(in srgb,var(--ok) 60%,transparent);animation:pulse 2.4s infinite}
@keyframes pulse{0%{box-shadow:0 0 0 0 color-mix(in srgb,var(--ok) 55%,transparent)}70%{box-shadow:0 0 0 7px transparent}100%{box-shadow:0 0 0 0 transparent}}
.chat-body{padding:18px 16px;min-height:290px;display:flex;flex-direction:column;gap:14px;font-size:14px}
.msg{display:flex;gap:10px;max-width:100%;animation:msgin .35s ease both}
@keyframes msgin{from{opacity:0;transform:translateY(6px)}to{opacity:1;transform:none}}
.msg.you{justify-content:flex-end}
.msg .av{width:26px;height:26px;border-radius:8px;flex:none;display:grid;place-items:center;margin-top:2px;overflow:hidden}
.msg .av img{width:26px;height:26px;filter:invert(var(--logo-invert))}
.bubble{padding:10px 13px;border-radius:14px;line-height:1.5;max-width:78%}
.you .bubble{background:var(--chip);border:1px solid var(--line);border-bottom-right-radius:5px}
.nyx .bubble{background:transparent;border:1px solid var(--line);border-bottom-left-radius:5px}
.caret{display:inline-block;width:2px;height:1.05em;transform:translateY(3px);margin-left:1px;background:var(--text);animation:blink 1s steps(2) infinite}
@keyframes blink{50%{opacity:0}}
.typing{display:inline-flex;gap:4px;align-items:center;padding:4px 2px}
.typing i{width:6px;height:6px;border-radius:50%;background:var(--faint);animation:td 1.2s infinite}
.typing i:nth-child(2){animation-delay:.18s}.typing i:nth-child(3){animation-delay:.36s}
@keyframes td{0%,60%,100%{opacity:.3;transform:translateY(0)}30%{opacity:1;transform:translateY(-3px)}}
.plan{margin-top:10px;border:1px solid var(--line);border-radius:12px;overflow:hidden;background:var(--panel)}
.plan-h{display:flex;align-items:center;gap:8px;padding:9px 12px;border-bottom:1px solid var(--line);font:500 11px/1 'JetBrains Mono';letter-spacing:.12em;text-transform:uppercase;color:var(--faint)}
.plan-row{display:flex;align-items:center;gap:10px;padding:9px 12px;font-size:13px}
.plan-row+.plan-row{border-top:1px solid var(--line)}
.plan-row .ck{width:16px;height:16px;flex:none;color:var(--muted)}
.plan-row .amt{margin-left:auto;font:450 12px/1 'JetBrains Mono';color:var(--faint)}
.plan-actions{display:flex;gap:8px;padding:10px 12px;border-top:1px solid var(--line)}
.mini{padding:8px 14px;border-radius:9px;font:600 12.5px/1 'Inter';cursor:default;border:1px solid var(--line);color:var(--text);background:transparent;display:inline-flex;align-items:center;gap:6px}
.mini.primary{background:var(--text);color:var(--bg);border-color:var(--text)}
.mini.primary.clicked{animation:press .3s ease}
@keyframes press{50%{transform:scale(.94)}}
.done{display:flex;align-items:center;gap:8px;color:var(--muted);font-size:13.5px;margin-top:2px}
.done .ok{color:var(--ok)}
.done code{font-family:'JetBrains Mono';font-size:12.5px;color:var(--text);background:var(--chip);padding:2px 6px;border-radius:5px}
.blocked .bubble{border-color:color-mix(in srgb,var(--bad) 45%,var(--line))}
.blocked .tag{display:inline-flex;align-items:center;gap:6px;font:600 10.5px/1 'JetBrains Mono';letter-spacing:.1em;text-transform:uppercase;color:var(--bad);margin-bottom:6px}
.chat-input{display:flex;align-items:center;gap:10px;padding:12px 14px;border-top:1px solid var(--line);color:var(--faint);font:450 13.5px/1 'Inter'}
.chat-input .send{margin-left:auto;width:30px;height:30px;border-radius:9px;display:grid;place-items:center;background:var(--text);color:var(--bg);font-weight:700;flex:none}

.section{padding:clamp(72px,10vw,128px) 0;position:relative}
.sec-head{max-width:640px;margin-bottom:52px}
.sec-head.ctr{margin-inline:auto;text-align:center}
.sec-title{font-size:clamp(30px,4.2vw,50px);margin-top:16px;letter-spacing:-.03em}
.sec-sub{margin-top:16px;color:var(--muted);font-size:17px;max-width:50ch}
.sec-head.ctr .sec-sub{margin-inline:auto}

.feats{display:grid;grid-template-columns:repeat(3,1fr);gap:1px;background:var(--line);border:1px solid var(--line);border-radius:var(--radlg);overflow:hidden}
.feat{background:var(--bg);padding:34px 30px;transition:background .3s}
.feat:hover{background:var(--bg-elev)}
.feat .fnum{font:500 12px/1 'JetBrains Mono';color:var(--faint);letter-spacing:.2em}
.feat .fico{width:44px;height:44px;border-radius:12px;border:1px solid var(--line);display:grid;place-items:center;margin:20px 0 22px;color:var(--text)}
.feat .fico svg{width:22px;height:22px}
.feat h3{font-family:'Space Grotesk';font-weight:600;font-size:22px;letter-spacing:-.02em;margin:0}
.feat p{margin-top:11px;color:var(--muted);font-size:14.5px}
@media(max-width:820px){.feats{grid-template-columns:1fr}}

.flow{display:grid;grid-template-columns:repeat(4,1fr);gap:0;border-top:1px solid var(--line)}
.stepc{position:relative;padding:30px 26px 30px 0;border-right:1px solid var(--line)}
.stepc:last-child{border-right:0}
.stepc .gh{font:500 13px/1 'JetBrains Mono';color:var(--faint);letter-spacing:.1em}
.stepc h3{font-family:'Space Grotesk';font-weight:600;font-size:19px;margin:20px 0 0;letter-spacing:-.01em}
.stepc p{margin-top:10px;color:var(--muted);font-size:14px;max-width:26ch}
@media(max-width:820px){.flow{grid-template-columns:1fr 1fr}.stepc{padding:26px 20px;border-right:0;border-bottom:1px solid var(--line)}}
@media(max-width:520px){.flow{grid-template-columns:1fr}}

.metrics{display:grid;grid-template-columns:repeat(3,1fr);gap:20px}
.metric{padding:34px 4px;border-top:1px solid var(--line2)}
.metric .num{font-family:'Space Grotesk';font-weight:600;font-size:clamp(52px,8vw,92px);line-height:.85;letter-spacing:-.05em}
.metric .lbl{margin-top:18px;color:var(--muted);font:450 14px/1.4 'JetBrains Mono'}
.proof-note{margin-top:40px;color:var(--faint);font-size:13.5px;font-family:'JetBrains Mono';max-width:60ch}
@media(max-width:760px){.metrics{grid-template-columns:1fr}}

.dl{display:grid;grid-template-columns:repeat(3,1fr);gap:16px}
.dl-card{border:1px solid var(--line);border-radius:var(--radlg);background:var(--bg-elev);padding:30px;display:flex;flex-direction:column;transition:.3s}
.dl-card:hover{border-color:var(--line2);transform:translateY(-3px);box-shadow:var(--shadow)}
.os{display:flex;align-items:center;gap:13px;margin-bottom:auto}
.os svg{width:26px;height:26px;color:var(--text)}
.dl-card h3{font-family:'Space Grotesk';font-weight:600;font-size:20px;margin:0}
.meta{color:var(--faint);font:450 12px/1 'JetBrains Mono';margin-top:5px}
.dl-card .btn{margin-top:26px}
@media(max-width:760px){.dl{grid-template-columns:1fr}}

.final{position:relative;border:1px solid var(--line);border-radius:var(--radlg);padding:clamp(56px,7vw,96px) 34px;text-align:center;background:var(--bg-elev)}
.final h2{font-size:clamp(36px,5.5vw,70px);max-width:15ch;margin-inline:auto;letter-spacing:-.035em}
.final p{margin:22px auto 0;max-width:44ch;color:var(--muted);font-size:17px}
.final .cta-row{justify-content:center;margin-top:34px}

.foot{border-top:1px solid var(--line);margin-top:80px;padding:66px 0 44px}
.foot-top{display:grid;grid-template-columns:1.8fr 1fr 1fr 1fr;gap:32px}
.foot-brand .brand{margin-bottom:16px}
.foot-brand p{color:var(--muted);font-size:14px;max-width:30ch}
.foot-col h4{font:500 11px/1 'JetBrains Mono';letter-spacing:.16em;text-transform:uppercase;color:var(--faint);margin-bottom:16px}
.foot-col a{display:block;color:var(--muted);font-size:14px;padding:6px 0;transition:.2s}
.foot-col a:hover{color:var(--text)}
.foot-bottom{display:flex;justify-content:space-between;align-items:center;gap:16px;margin-top:54px;padding-top:24px;border-top:1px solid var(--line);color:var(--faint);font:450 12px/1 'JetBrains Mono';flex-wrap:wrap}
.socials{display:flex;gap:9px}
.socials a{width:36px;height:36px;border-radius:10px;display:grid;place-items:center;border:1px solid var(--line);color:var(--muted);transition:.2s}
.socials a:hover{border-color:var(--line2);color:var(--text)}
.socials svg{width:16px;height:16px}
@media(max-width:860px){.foot-top{grid-template-columns:1fr 1fr}}
@media(max-width:520px){.foot-top{grid-template-columns:1fr}}
@media(max-width:960px){.hero-grid{grid-template-columns:1fr;gap:48px}.nav-links{display:none}.hero{padding-top:40px}}
.reveal{opacity:0;transform:translateY(22px);transition:opacity .7s cubic-bezier(.2,.8,.2,1),transform .7s cubic-bezier(.2,.8,.2,1)}
.reveal.in{opacity:1;transform:none}
::view-transition-old(root){animation:none}
::view-transition-new(root){animation:vt .5s cubic-bezier(.4,0,.2,1)}
@keyframes vt{from{clip-path:circle(0 at var(--x,92%) var(--y,4%))}to{clip-path:circle(150% at var(--x,92%) var(--y,4%))}}
@media(prefers-reduced-motion:reduce){.chat-status i,.caret,.typing i{animation:none!important}.reveal{opacity:1;transform:none}.hero h1{animation:none}::view-transition-new(root){animation:none}}
/* ---- models ---- */
.models{display:grid;grid-template-columns:repeat(4,1fr);gap:16px}
.mcard{position:relative;display:flex;flex-direction:column;border:1px solid var(--line);border-radius:var(--radlg);background:var(--bg-elev);padding:28px 22px;transition:.3s}
.mcard:hover{border-color:var(--line2);transform:translateY(-3px);box-shadow:var(--shadow)}
.mcard.featured{border-color:var(--text)}
.mbadge{position:absolute;top:-11px;left:22px;background:var(--text);color:var(--bg);font:600 11px/1 'JetBrains Mono',monospace;letter-spacing:.03em;padding:6px 11px;border-radius:999px}
.mtier{font-family:'Space Grotesk',sans-serif;font-weight:600;font-size:22px;letter-spacing:-.02em}
.msize{font:450 12px/1 'JetBrains Mono',monospace;color:var(--faint);margin-top:6px}
.mfor{margin-top:14px;color:var(--muted);font-size:14px;min-height:56px}
.mspec{list-style:none;margin:16px 0 0;padding:16px 0 0;border-top:1px solid var(--line);display:flex;flex-direction:column;gap:11px}
.mspec li{display:flex;justify-content:space-between;align-items:baseline;gap:12px;font-size:13.5px}
.mspec .sk{color:var(--faint);flex:none}
.mspec b{text-align:right;font-weight:600}
.mnote{display:flex;gap:16px;align-items:flex-start;margin-top:22px;padding:22px 24px;border:1px solid var(--line);border-radius:var(--radlg);background:var(--panel)}
.mnote-i{font-size:22px;line-height:1.2;flex:none}
.mnote p{color:var(--muted);font-size:14.5px}
.mnote b{color:var(--text)}
@media(max-width:960px){.models{grid-template-columns:1fr 1fr}.mfor{min-height:0}}
@media(max-width:560px){.models{grid-template-columns:1fr}}

/* ---- install ---- */
.install{display:grid;grid-template-columns:1.1fr .9fr;gap:16px;align-items:start}
.install-card{border:1px solid var(--line2);border-radius:var(--radlg);background:var(--bg-elev);padding:30px;box-shadow:var(--shadow)}
.install-card .os{margin-bottom:22px}
.install-card h3{font-family:'Space Grotesk',sans-serif;font-weight:600;font-size:22px;margin:0}
.install-card .meta{color:var(--faint);font:450 12px/1 'JetBrains Mono',monospace;margin-top:6px}
.install-card .btn{margin-top:24px}
.install-note{margin-top:16px;color:var(--faint);font-size:13px}
.facts{list-style:none;margin:0;padding:8px 30px;border:1px solid var(--line);border-radius:var(--radlg);background:var(--panel)}
.facts li{display:flex;justify-content:space-between;align-items:center;gap:14px;padding:14px 0;font-size:14px}
.facts li+li{border-top:1px solid var(--line)}
.facts .k{color:var(--faint);font:450 12px/1 'JetBrains Mono',monospace;letter-spacing:.03em;flex:none}
.facts .v{text-align:right;font-weight:500}
.steps{display:grid;grid-template-columns:repeat(4,1fr);gap:0;margin-top:36px;border-top:1px solid var(--line)}
.istep{padding:28px 24px 0 0;border-right:1px solid var(--line)}
.istep:last-child{border-right:0}
.istep .gh{font:500 13px/1 'JetBrains Mono',monospace;color:var(--faint)}
.istep h3{font-family:'Space Grotesk',sans-serif;font-weight:600;font-size:18px;margin:16px 0 0}
.istep p{margin-top:10px;color:var(--muted);font-size:14px}
.istep a{color:var(--text);text-decoration:underline;text-underline-offset:3px}
@media(max-width:860px){.install{grid-template-columns:1fr}.steps{grid-template-columns:1fr 1fr}.istep{border-right:0;border-bottom:1px solid var(--line);padding:24px 20px}}
@media(max-width:520px){.steps{grid-template-columns:1fr}}

/* ---- faq ---- */
.faq{display:flex;flex-direction:column;gap:12px;max-width:820px;margin-inline:auto}
.qa{border:1px solid var(--line);border-radius:14px;background:var(--bg-elev);overflow:hidden}
.qa summary{list-style:none;cursor:pointer;display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:space-between;gap:16px;padding:18px 22px;font:500 16px/1.35 'Inter',sans-serif;color:var(--text)}
.qa summary::-webkit-details-marker{display:none}
.qa .chev{font-family:'JetBrains Mono',monospace;font-size:20px;color:var(--faint);flex:none;transition:transform .25s}
.qa[open] .chev{transform:rotate(45deg)}
.qa .ans{padding:0 22px 20px;color:var(--muted);font-size:14.5px;line-height:1.6}
.qa .ans a{color:var(--text);text-decoration:underline;text-underline-offset:3px}
.faq-cta{display:flex;flex-direction:column;align-items:center;gap:18px;margin-top:44px;text-align:center}
.faq-cta .fct{color:var(--muted);font-size:15px}
@media(max-width:520px){.qa summary{font-size:15px;padding:16px 18px}}
/* ---- premium steps redesign (how it works + install) ---- */
.flow,.steps{grid-template-columns:repeat(4,1fr);gap:16px;border-top:0;margin-top:8px}
.stepc,.istep{position:relative;padding:30px 26px;border:1px solid var(--line);border-radius:var(--radlg);background:var(--bg-elev);transition:transform .3s,border-color .3s,box-shadow .3s}
.stepc:last-child,.istep:last-child{border-right:1px solid var(--line)}
.stepc:hover,.istep:hover{border-color:var(--line2);transform:translateY(-4px);box-shadow:var(--shadow)}
.stepc .gh,.istep .gh{display:inline-flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center;width:46px;height:46px;border:1px solid var(--line2);border-radius:50%;font:600 15px/1 'JetBrains Mono',monospace;color:var(--text);letter-spacing:0;background:var(--panel)}
.stepc h3,.istep h3{font-family:'Space Grotesk',sans-serif;font-weight:600;font-size:19px;margin:22px 0 0;letter-spacing:-.01em}
.stepc p,.istep p{margin-top:10px;color:var(--muted);font-size:14px;max-width:none}
.istep a{color:var(--text);text-decoration:underline;text-underline-offset:3px}
@media(max-width:820px){.flow,.steps{grid-template-columns:1fr 1fr}.stepc,.istep{border:1px solid var(--line)}}
@media(max-width:520px){.flow,.steps{grid-template-columns:1fr}}
</style>
<style id="nyx-verify-css">.nyx-verify{margin-top:8px;border:1px solid var(--line);border-radius:12px;background:var(--panel);overflow:hidden;max-width:340px}.nyx-verify-chip{list-style:none;cursor:pointer;display:flex;align-items:center;gap:8px;padding:8px 12px;font:600 13px/1 "Space Grotesk",sans-serif;color:var(--text);user-select:none}.nyx-verify-chip::-webkit-details-marker{display:none}.nyx-verify .vok{display:inline-flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center;width:18px;height:18px;border-radius:50%;background:#16321f;color:#4ade80;font-size:12px}.nyx-verify[open] .nyx-verify-chip{border-bottom:1px solid var(--line)}.nyx-verify-card{padding:10px 12px;display:flex;flex-direction:column;gap:9px}.nyx-verify-card .vrow{display:flex;justify-content:space-between;gap:14px;font-size:12.5px}.nyx-verify-card .vrow b{color:var(--faint);font-weight:600;white-space:nowrap}.nyx-verify-card .vrow span{color:var(--muted);text-align:right}.nyx-verify-card code{font:12px "JetBrains Mono",monospace;color:var(--text)}</style><style id="nyx-cards-css">.mtier{display:flex;align-items:center;gap:8px;flex-wrap:wrap}.mbadge{font:600 10px/1 "Space Grotesk",sans-serif;letter-spacing:.04em;text-transform:uppercase;color:#4ade80;background:#16321f;padding:3px 7px;border-radius:999px}.malt{margin-top:12px;padding-top:10px;border-top:1px solid var(--line);font-size:11.5px;color:var(--faint)}</style><style id="nyx-modal-css">.nyx-modal-ov{position:fixed;inset:0;background:rgba(0,0,0,.6);-webkit-backdrop-filter:blur(4px);backdrop-filter:blur(4px);display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center;z-index:9999;opacity:0;transition:opacity .18s}.nyx-modal-ov.show{opacity:1}.nyx-modal{background:var(--panel,#12141a);border:1px solid var(--line,#242833);border-radius:16px;padding:26px 24px;max-width:380px;width:calc(100% - 40px);text-align:center;box-shadow:0 24px 70px rgba(0,0,0,.55);transform:translateY(10px);transition:transform .18s}.nyx-modal-ov.show .nyx-modal{transform:none}.nyx-modal .ico{width:48px;height:48px;margin:0 auto 14px;border-radius:13px;display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center;background:#1c1f29;font-size:22px}.nyx-modal h3{margin:0 0 8px;font:600 20px/1.2 "Space Grotesk",sans-serif;color:var(--text,#fff)}.nyx-modal p{margin:0 0 18px;font-size:14px;line-height:1.55;color:var(--muted,#9aa0ab)}.nyx-modal .row{display:flex;gap:10px;justify-content:center}.nyx-modal button{cursor:pointer;border-radius:10px;padding:10px 16px;font:600 14px/1 "Space Grotesk",sans-serif;border:1px solid var(--line,#242833);background:transparent;color:var(--text,#fff)}.nyx-modal .primary{background:var(--blue,#7c5cff);border-color:transparent;color:#fff}</style>  <link rel="stylesheet" href="/site-polish.css">
</head>
<body>
<div class="bg-grid"></div>
<div class="bg-glow"></div>
<div class="progress" id="progress"></div>

<header class="nav" id="nav"><div class="wrap"><div class="nav-in">
  <a class="brand" href="#top"><img class="logo" src="logo.svg" alt="Nyx"><span>Nyx</span></a>
  <nav class="nav-links">
    <a href="#features" data-i18n="nav_features">Features</a>
    <a href="#how" data-i18n="nav_how">How it works</a>
    <a href="#proof" data-i18n="nav_proof">Proof</a>
    <a href="#models">Models</a>
    <a href="#download" data-i18n="nav_download">Download</a>
  </nav>
  <div class="controls">
    <button class="tswitch" id="theme" role="switch" aria-label="Toggle theme">
      <span class="tswitch-ico sun"><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round"><circle cx="12" cy="12" r="5"></circle><path d="M12 1v2M12 21v2M4.2 4.2l1.4 1.4M18.4 18.4l1.4 1.4M1 12h2M21 12h2M4.2 19.8l1.4-1.4M18.4 5.6l1.4-1.4"></path></svg></span>
      <span class="tswitch-ico moon"><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="currentColor" stroke="none"><path d="M21 12.8A9 9 0 1 1 11.2 3a7 7 0 0 0 9.8 9.8z"></path></svg></span>
      <span class="tswitch-thumb"></span>
    </button>
    
    <a class="btn btn-sm btn-primary" href="/app" data-i18n="nav_launch">Launch app</a>
  </div>
</div></div></header>

<main id="top">
<section class="hero"><div class="wrap"><div class="hero-grid">
  <div class="hero-copy">
    <h1 class="disp" data-i18n="hero_h1" style="white-space:pre-line">Your Local
PC Copilot</h1>
    <p class="lead" data-i18n="hero_sub">A local-first assistant that runs entirely on your machine, shows its plan before it moves, and acts only once you approve.</p>
    <div class="cta-row">
      <a class="btn btn-primary" href="/app"><span data-i18n="hero_cta1">Launch the app</span><span class="arw">→</span></a>
      <a class="btn" href="#download" data-i18n="hero_cta2">Download for Windows</a>
    </div>
    <div class="trust">
      <span><b></b><span data-i18n="hero_t1">No account</span></span>
      <span><b></b><span data-i18n="hero_t2">No cloud</span></span>
      <span><b></b><span data-i18n="hero_t3">No telemetry</span></span>
    </div>
  </div>

  <div class="chat reveal" id="chat">
    <div class="chat-head">
      <div class="chat-av"><img src="logo.svg" alt=""></div>
      <div class="chat-id">Nyx</div>
      <div class="chat-status"><i></i><span data-i18n="chat_status">Local</span></div>
    </div>
    <div class="chat-body" id="chatBody"></div>
    <div class="chat-input"><span data-i18n="app_ph" id="appPh">Ask Nyx to do something…</span><span class="send">↑</span></div>
  </div>
</div></div></section>
<section class="section" id="features"><div class="wrap">
  <div class="sec-head reveal">
    <span class="eyebrow" data-i18n="feat_eyebrow">Built different</span>
    <h2 class="disp sec-title" data-i18n="feat_h2">Powerful on your PC. Private by default.</h2>
    <p class="sec-sub" data-i18n="feat_sub">The model, the reasoning and your files never leave the machine. Nyx works offline and keeps every action under your control.</p>
  </div>
  <div class="feats reveal">
    <div class="feat">
      <span class="fnum">01</span>
      <div class="fico"><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.7"><rect x="3" y="4" width="18" height="12" rx="2"></rect><path d="M8 20h8M12 16v4"></path></svg></div>
      <h3 data-i18n="f1_t">Runs fully on-device</h3>
      <p data-i18n="f1_d">Your model runs locally through the QVAC SDK — pick the size that fits your PC. No servers, no API keys, nothing leaves your machine.</p>
    </div>
    <div class="feat">
      <span class="fnum">02</span>
      <div class="fico"><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.7"><path d="M9 11l3 3 8-8"></path><path d="M21 12a9 9 0 1 1-6.2-8.6"></path></svg></div>
      <h3 data-i18n="f2_t">Plans before it acts</h3>
      <p data-i18n="f2_d">Every task is shown as a clear plan first. Nothing runs until you approve it — you stay in control at all times.</p>
    </div>
    <div class="feat">
      <span class="fnum">03</span>
      <div class="fico"><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.7"><path d="M12 3l7 3v6c0 4.5-3 7.5-7 9-4-1.5-7-4.5-7-9V6l7-3z"></path><path d="M9 12l2 2 4-4"></path></svg></div>
      <h3 data-i18n="f3_t">Guarded &amp; signed</h3>
      <p data-i18n="f3_d">NetGuard blocks unknown hosts and the validator refuses destructive commands. Every action leaves a signed receipt.</p>
    </div>
  </div>
</div></section>

<section class="section" id="how" style="padding-top:0"><div class="wrap">
  <div class="sec-head reveal">
    <span class="eyebrow" data-i18n="how_eyebrow">How it works</span>
    <h2 class="disp sec-title" data-i18n="how_h2">From request to signed result.</h2>
  </div>
  <div class="flow reveal">
    <div class="stepc"><span class="gh">01</span><h3 data-i18n="s1_t">Ask</h3><p data-i18n="s1_d">Describe what you want in plain language — no commands to memorize.</p></div>
    <div class="stepc"><span class="gh">02</span><h3 data-i18n="s2_t">Review the plan</h3><p data-i18n="s2_d">Nyx breaks it into concrete steps and shows exactly what it will touch.</p></div>
    <div class="stepc"><span class="gh">03</span><h3 data-i18n="s3_t">Approve</h3><p data-i18n="s3_d">You confirm. The validator and NetGuard keep risky actions out.</p></div>
    <div class="stepc"><span class="gh">04</span><h3 data-i18n="s4_t">Get a receipt</h3><p data-i18n="s4_d">Every run is signed and saved to ./evidence so you can verify it later.</p></div>
  </div>
</div></section>

<section class="section" id="proof" style="padding-top:0"><div class="wrap">
  <div class="sec-head reveal">
    <span class="eyebrow" data-i18n="proof_eyebrow">The numbers</span>
    <h2 class="disp sec-title" data-i18n="proof_h2">Local by design, not by promise.</h2>
  </div>
  <div class="metrics reveal">
    <div class="metric"><div class="num"><span class="n" data-target="100">0</span>%</div><div class="lbl" data-i18n="m1_l">of inference runs on your device</div></div>
    <div class="metric"><div class="num"><span class="n" data-target="0">0</span></div><div class="lbl" data-i18n="m2_l">bytes of your data sent to the cloud</div></div>
    <div class="metric"><div class="num"><span class="n" data-target="100">0</span>%</div><div class="lbl" data-i18n="m3_l">of actions require your approval</div></div>
  </div>
  <p class="proof-note reveal" data-i18n="proof_note">Open source under Apache-2.0. Read the code, run the verifier, check the signed receipts yourself.</p>
</div></section>

<section class="section" id="models" style="padding-top:0"><div class="wrap">
  <div class="sec-head reveal">
    <span class="eyebrow">Choose your brain</span>
    <h2 class="disp sec-title">One app. A model for every PC.</h2>
    <p class="sec-sub">Nyx isn't locked to a single model. Weak laptop or a beast rig — pick the size that runs smoothly on your hardware. On first launch Nyx checks your specs and pre-selects the best fit; you can switch anytime.</p>
  </div>
  <div class="models reveal">
    <div class="mcard">
      <div class="mtier">Lite</div>
      <div class="msize">~1B params</div>
      <p class="mfor">For older laptops and office PCs with no graphics card.</p>
      <ul class="mspec">
        <li><span class="sk">Runs on</span><b>CPU only</b></li>
        <li><span class="sk">Memory</span><b>3 GB+ RAM</b></li>
        <li><span class="sk">Feel</span><b>Instant, snappy</b></li>
        <li><span class="sk">Best for</span><b>Quick tasks, files, everyday commands</b></li>
      </ul>
    </div>
    <div class="mcard featured">
      <div class="mbadge">Most people pick this</div>
      <div class="mtier">Balanced</div>
      <div class="msize">~4B params</div>
      <p class="mfor">The sweet spot for most modern laptops and desktops.</p>
      <ul class="mspec">
        <li><span class="sk">Runs on</span><b>CPU or entry GPU</b></li>
        <li><span class="sk">Memory</span><b>8 GB+ RAM</b></li>
        <li><span class="sk">Feel</span><b>Fast &amp; noticeably smarter</b></li>
        <li><span class="sk">Best for</span><b>Daily driving, writing, light coding</b></li>
      </ul>
    </div>
    <div class="mcard">
      <div class="mtier">Pro</div>
      <div class="msize">~8B params</div>
      <p class="mfor">For gaming PCs and workstations with a real GPU.</p>
      <ul class="mspec">
        <li><span class="sk">Runs on</span><b>8–12 GB VRAM GPU</b></li>
        <li><span class="sk">Memory</span><b>16 GB+ RAM</b></li>
        <li><span class="sk">Feel</span><b>Deeper reasoning</b></li>
        <li><span class="sk">Best for</span><b>Coding, multi-step tasks, long context</b></li>
      </ul>
    </div>
    <div class="mcard">
      <div class="mtier">Standard</div>
      <div class="msize">~3B params</div>
      <p class="mfor">A light step up from Lite for everyday work on typical laptops.</p>
      <ul class="mspec">
        <li><span class="sk">Runs on</span><b>CPU or a basic laptop GPU</b></li>
        <li><span class="sk">Memory</span><b>6 GB+ RAM</b></li>
        <li><span class="sk">Feel</span><b>Balanced speed and quality</b></li>
        <li><span class="sk">Best for</span><b>Everyday assistant tasks</b></li>
      </ul>
    </div>
  </div>
  <div class="mnote reveal">
    <div class="mnote-i">⚡</div>
    <p><b>Built to stay smooth.</b> Nyx runs models through QVAC's on-device runtime with memory-saving quantization (TurboQuant), so even the Lite tier stays responsive on modest hardware and bigger models don't eat all your VRAM. If your PC ever struggles, drop a tier and Nyx keeps up.</p>
  </div>
</div></section>

<section class="section" id="download" style="padding-top:0"><div class="wrap">
  <div class="sec-head ctr reveal">
    <span class="eyebrow" data-i18n="dl_eyebrow">Get Nyx</span>
    <h2 class="disp sec-title">Up and running in about a minute.</h2>
    <p class="sec-sub">One download for Windows. No account, no setup maze — install it, pick a model that fits your PC, and start asking.</p>
  </div>
  <div class="install reveal">
    <div class="install-card">
      <div class="os"><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="currentColor"><path d="M3 5.5L10.5 4.5v7H3zM11.5 4.3L21 3v8.5h-9.5zM3 12.5h7.5v7L3 18.5zM11.5 12.5H21V21l-9.5-1.3z"/></svg><div><h3>Nyx for Windows</h3><div class="meta">Windows 10 / 11 · 64-bit · ~<span data-nyx-size>888 MB</span> installer</div></div></div>
      <a class="btn btn-primary" href="https://github.com/aar0n4ik/Nyx"><span>Download for Windows</span><span class="arw">→</span></a>
      <p class="install-note">macOS and Linux builds are on the way. Today Nyx is tuned and tested for Windows.</p>
    </div>
    <ul class="facts">
      <li><span class="k">Cost</span><span class="v">Free &amp; open source</span></li>
      <li><span class="k">Account</span><span class="v">None needed</span></li>
      <li><span class="k">Internet</span><span class="v">Only to download — runs offline after</span></li>
      <li><span class="k">Disk</span><span class="v">~<span data-nyx-size>888 MB</span> app + 1–5 GB per model</span></li>
    </ul>
  </div>
  <div class="steps reveal">
    <div class="istep"><span class="gh">01</span><h3>Download &amp; install</h3><p>Grab the installer, run it, click through. No admin gymnastics, no bundled junk — about a minute start to finish.</p></div>
    <div class="istep"><span class="gh">02</span><h3>Pick your model</h3><p>On first launch Nyx reads your hardware and recommends a model that will run smoothly. <a href="#models">See which one fits your PC →</a></p></div>
    <div class="istep"><span class="gh">03</span><h3>It downloads once</h3><p>Your model is fetched a single time (1–5 GB by tier) and stored locally. After that Nyx works with no internet at all.</p></div>
    <div class="istep"><span class="gh">04</span><h3>Just ask</h3><p>Type what you want in plain words. Nyx shows a plan, you approve, it acts — and every run is signed to ./evidence.</p></div>
  </div>
</div></section>

<section class="section" id="faq" style="padding-top:0"><div class="wrap">
  <div class="sec-head ctr reveal">
    <span class="eyebrow">Good questions</span>
    <h2 class="disp sec-title">Everything you're probably wondering.</h2>
  </div>
  <div class="faq reveal">
    <details class="qa"><summary>Is my data actually private?<span class="chev">+</span></summary><div class="ans">Completely. Everything runs on your machine — your files, your prompts, and the model itself never leave your PC. No account, no cloud, no telemetry. Pull out the network cable and Nyx still works.</div></details>
    <details class="qa"><summary>Will it slow down or lag my computer?<span class="chev">+</span></summary><div class="ans">Nyx is built to stay light. It runs a model sized for your hardware and only loads it while you're actually using it. On a modest PC, choose the Lite tier and it stays responsive — if things ever feel heavy, drop a tier and it speeds right back up.</div></details>
    <details class="qa"><summary>What if my PC is weak or a few years old?<span class="chev">+</span></summary><div class="ans">You're covered. Nyx runs on CPU-only machines with 8 GB of RAM using the Lite model. On first launch it checks your specs and recommends the model that will actually run well — no guessing, no trial and error.</div></details>
    <details class="qa"><summary>Can I choose which model to use?<span class="chev">+</span></summary><div class="ans">Yes — Nyx isn't tied to one model. Start with the recommended pick and switch to a bigger or smaller one whenever you like, right inside the app. <a href="#models">Compare the tiers →</a></div></details>
    <details class="qa"><summary>Is it safe to let an AI touch my PC?<span class="chev">+</span></summary><div class="ans">Nyx never acts on its own. It shows you a plain-English plan first, and nothing runs until you approve it. A validator blocks destructive commands, NetGuard blocks unknown network access, and every action is signed to ./evidence so you can check exactly what happened.</div></details>
    <details class="qa"><summary>Do I need to be technical to use it?<span class="chev">+</span></summary><div class="ans">Not at all. You talk to it in normal language — “clean up my downloads”, “why is my PC slow”, “rename these files by date”. There are no commands to memorize.</div></details>
    <details class="qa"><summary>Is it really free?<span class="chev">+</span></summary><div class="ans">Yes, and it's open source under Apache-2.0. No trial, no subscription, no upsell. You can read the code, run the verifier, and check the signed receipts yourself.</div></details>
    <details class="qa"><summary>How much space does it need?<span class="chev">+</span></summary><div class="ans">The app itself is about (~<span data-nyx-size>888 MB</span>). Each model you pick is downloaded once and stored locally — about 1 GB for the Lite tier up to about 5 GB for the Pro tier. You only ever download the models you choose.</div></details>
  </div>
</div></section>
</main>

